  "description": "Chalet is a box-tower play structure from the Solitaire series of our NexLev range. Its towers are linked by a U-shaped net crawl tunnel, a ladder leads up, and a red and cream spiral tube slide brings children back down. Most of the fun is in the tunnel, where children crawl from one tower to the next before choosing to slide. Chalet holds 30 to 35 children. The product area is 24'8\" x 18'9\" and the safe play area is 30'8\" x 24'9\". That suits a mid-sized society garden or a school's junior play area. Skills listed for Chalet are strength, team building and self-directed play. It is finished in mixed colours. We give 3 years of warranty on the galvanised pipes, the roto-moulded slide, the composite laminates and the play rope. Ask us for a layout drawing for your garden.",
